WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.291 --> 00:00:03.541
-Jokic is unstoppable! 

00:00:03.541 --> 00:00:04.916
-Duncan, take the shot.

00:00:04.916 --> 00:00:07.375
-I missed so badly! Aaah

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:10.000
-Are we done? I miss my horses.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.666
-Mid-range dagger! 

00:00:12.083 --> 00:00:13.166
-No look hammer!

00:00:14.375 --> 00:00:17.500
-All... those... 3am chin-ups... led me to this.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Gasp

00:00:18.125 --> 00:00:21.000
-You're tired, now you can rest.

00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:24.625
-AHHHHHHHHHH!

00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:27.750
-[Radio]: Dame to Miami is a sure thing.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:29.583
We’ve got all the leverage.

00:00:29.583 --> 00:00:32.250
Pat Riley’s got nine rings for a reason. 

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.250
-This is the story of how we followed up a disappointing finals…

00:00:39.875 --> 00:00:41.625
-You wanted to see me, Godfather?

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:43.416
-Yes, Jimmy. 

00:00:43.958 --> 00:00:46.416
…with an even worse off-season.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:51.125
-We need another hero. Another alpha.

00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:52.916
-But Boss, I'm the alpha. 

00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:55.208
-We'll just work harder this year. That's Heat Culture. 

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.500
-I'M PAT F***ING RILEY. I AM HEAT CULTURE. 

00:01:00.166 --> 00:01:03.958
-This is a tale of hubris, greed…. 

00:01:05.291 --> 00:01:06.625
and tragedy.

00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:11.125
-Here's his coordinates. Get him.

00:01:11.125 --> 00:01:12.750
-Why doesn't he come here?

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:15.875
-The city won’t let him leave.

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:18.916
-This is how the Heat flamed out in Portland.

00:01:18.916 --> 00:01:22.166
-What kind of hippie bullshit is this? 

00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:24.375
-Jimmy! 
-Oh, you gotta try OUR coffee. 

00:01:24.375 --> 00:01:25.250
-Have you met Scoot?

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:25.875
-Huh?!

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:30.000
-Damn, Dame. You DO need help. 

00:01:59.125 --> 00:01:59.916
-Thanks. 

00:01:59.916 --> 00:02:02.625
♪ Wow, Portland. How do I begin to fix this? ♪

00:02:02.625 --> 00:02:05.625
♪ I’m so close to being heated, but this is a business ♪

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.625
♪ I gotta Scoot away, I’m sorry for the-

00:02:07.625 --> 00:02:08.625
-Sorry? 

00:02:08.625 --> 00:02:10.041
-Does that "sorry" come with a first round pick?!

00:02:10.041 --> 00:02:10.875
-I forgive you.

00:02:10.875 --> 00:02:13.291
-Calm down. You also get...

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:14.916
-Tyler Herro! 

00:02:14.916 --> 00:02:17.500
-Damn, son. I guess there ain’t no friends in this business.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:18.958
It is what it is, feel me?

00:02:19.416 --> 00:02:22.416
-We're not idiots!

00:02:22.416 --> 00:02:24.791
What ever happened to loyalty? 

00:02:24.791 --> 00:02:26.750
You have roots here! 

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.833
-Don't go Dame Time. I'm the dog here. I'll get us out. 

00:02:33.791 --> 00:02:36.083
-Look, we're building around you!

00:02:36.083 --> 00:02:38.166
Isn't that what you wanted? 

00:02:38.166 --> 00:02:40.833
-Don't expect me to stand in the corner and wait for my shot. 

00:02:41.083 --> 00:02:43.791
-Hahaha, GUILT TRIP!

00:02:43.791 --> 00:02:45.000
-I just bought your jersey!

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.291
-I named my dog after you!

00:02:46.291 --> 00:02:48.125
-I moved here for you!

00:02:49.333 --> 00:02:52.583
-Now we want to hold onto Dame...even...more! 

00:02:53.833 --> 00:02:55.375
-I can run all day...

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:57.750
but I think it's time to blow up another small market. 

00:03:02.541 --> 00:03:05.000
-But that's... way too intense.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.916
-No, that's just Jimmy.

00:03:09.166 --> 00:03:10.791
Why is this so difficult!

00:03:11.208 --> 00:03:13.625
-Hey. Someone left all these bombs around.

00:03:13.625 --> 00:03:16.166
Sorry I'm late. I had to fend off the raptors.

00:03:16.166 --> 00:03:17.041
-Giannis?!

00:03:17.041 --> 00:03:19.250
-No no no, I can’t let you go with him!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:24.625
-You think you can come in here all cocky, offer no sacrifice...

00:03:24.625 --> 00:03:26.250
...and threaten to blow us up?!

00:03:26.583 --> 00:03:29.000
The Bucks respected us!

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:31.583
They offered us a fair package.

00:03:31.583 --> 00:03:35.041
They never demanded anything from us.

00:03:35.708 --> 00:03:39.000
So take him, Giannis. He's yours.

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:42.041
-Oh, wow, the Cream City Dojo is now stacked!

00:03:42.041 --> 00:03:43.833
Maybe I will stay.

00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:45.333
-Sorry, Jimmy.

00:03:45.333 --> 00:03:47.791
But now we both know we're ready for a partner.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:49.458
Thanks. 

00:03:51.375 --> 00:03:53.666
-We got played!!!!

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.416
-[Radio]: I mean, Pat Riley’s only got 9 rings...

00:03:58.416 --> 00:03:59.541
Guy’s gotta go.

00:04:01.375 --> 00:04:04.208
-Ooh hell yeah, this joint slaps.

